Rad Racer, feel the awesome power of 3D rally racing!

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:28.840
And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.040
I'm Mike.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.720
I'm Sam. And I'm Sean.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.820
How's it going guys?

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:33.760
I'm doing good.

