Okay. I feel like there's an intruder here.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.380
Do you think the listeners feel like there's an intruder here?

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.000
I feel like now they do.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.860
Depends on if they're like listening to it like on a portable speaker in their bathroom

